type: ['Legendary Artifact Creature — Sphinx', 'Legendary Creature — Beast', 'Legendary Creature — Bird Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Dragon', 'Legendary Creature — Elemental Beast', 'Legendary Creature — Elf Shaman', 'Legendary Creature — Faerie', 'Legendary Creature — Giant Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Goblin Artificer', 'Legendary Creature — Human Artificer', 'Legendary Creature — Orc Shaman', 'Legendary Creature — Rhino Soldier', 'Legendary Creature — Vampire Wizard', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Assassin', 'Legendary Creature — Zombie Wizard']
supertypes: ['Legendary']
subtypes: ['Artificer', 'Assassin', 'Beast', 'Bird', 'Dragon', 'Elemental', 'Elf', 'Faerie', 'Giant', 'Goblin', 'Human', 'Orc', 'Rhino', 'Shaman', 'Soldier', 'Sphinx', 'Vampire', 'Wizard', 'Zombie']
rarity: ['Mythic', 'Rare']
text: ["At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws an additional card.\\nWhenever an opponent draws a card, Nekusar, the Mindrazer deals 1 damage to that player.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 2 life.\\nWhenever you gain life, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card and each opponent loses 1 life.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if Oloro, Ageless Ascetic is in the command zone, you gain 2 life.', "Flying\\nWhen Jeleva, Nephalia's Scourge enters the battlefield, each player exiles the top X cards of their library, where X is the amount of mana spent to cast Jeleva.\\nWhenever Jeleva attacks, you may cast an instant or sorcery spell from among cards exiled with Jeleva without paying its mana cost.", 'Flying\\nWhen Sharuum the Hegemon enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Derevi, Empyrial Tactician enters the battlefield or a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, you may tap or untap target permanent.\\n{1}{G}{W}{U}: Put Derevi onto the battlefield from the command zone.', 'Haste\\nWhenever Thraximundar attacks, defending player sacrifices a creature.\\nWhenever a player sacrifices a creature, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Thraximundar.', "Marath, Will of the Wild enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the amount of mana spent to cast it.\\n{X}, Remove X +1/+1 counters from Marath: Choose one —\\n• Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature. X can't be 0.\\n• Marath deals X damage to any target. X can't be 0.\\n• Create an X/X green Elemental creature token. X can't be 0.", "Vigilance, trample\\n{2}, {T}: Exile another target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'When you cast this spell, create X 0/1 red Kobold creature tokens named Kobolds of Kher Keep, where X is the amount of mana spent to cast it.\\nFlying\\nSacrifice another creature: Prossh, Skyraider of Kher gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature attacks one of your opponents or a planeswalker an opponent controls, that creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever another nontoken creature you control dies, create a 3/1 black and red Graveborn creature token with haste.', 'You may choose not to untap Rubinia Soulsinger during your untap step.\\n{T}: Gain control of target creature for as long as you control Rubinia and Rubinia remains tapped.', '{2}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Each other player sacrifices a creature.\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Each other player sacrifices an artifact.\\n{2}{G}, Sacrifice an enchantment: Each other player sacrifices an enchantment.', '{3}{R}{G}{W}, {T}: Look at the top five cards of your library. You may put a creature card with power 5 or greater from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', '{U}: Target noncreature artifact becomes an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana value until end of turn.\\n{W}{B}: Target artifact creature gains deathtouch and lifelink until end of turn.']
flavor: ['"Take up the quill, and feel your future flow into the runes."', '"Time and space are just new battlefields to be mastered."', 'He can stir the gentlest spirit to wild ferocity.', "His enemies wondered if the lich king's brutal death and unnatural rebirth had been his plan all along.", 'His name means "he who paints the earth red."', "The orcs believe Sek'Kuar still lives in the Karplusan Mountains, gathering his dead army, intent on revenge.", "The sacred Anima's eyes are blind to all but the grandest truths.", 'To gain audience with the hegemon, one must bring a riddle she has not heard.']
artist: ['Brynn Metheney', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Izzy', 'Jason Chan', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Kev Walker', 'Mark Winters', 'Michael Komarck', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Steve Prescott', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tyler Jacobson']
